  "details": "Description\n\nsuddenly experiencing lag, disconnections, and avatars not loading. i have changed nothing on my computer, my internet is strong, ram isnt being used up, no problems on my computer. it seems to be a vrc server issue for me.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\ni just updated my drivers last week and that is when it broke. updated drivers, got onto a wired pcvr connection, noticed sudden worsening of connection. reverted to old drivers and problem still presists.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Networking\n\n- Frequency: Often\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3p2-1921-15c4a824b2-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-10-21_23-16-47.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_cbcde230-547b-4097-a660-0ecdef8718f1/1/file)",
